{"about_the_game":"In this game you will have the experience of returning to the happiness and sweetness of your childhood, you will calmly go through all kinds of danger and nothing bad will happen to you, just trust that you are capable of achieving it.<br>When you reach a score of 50,000, a good message awaits you!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the gameplay:</h2>\u2022 This is an arcade-style casual game;<br><br>\u2022 The player has his score increased over time;<br>\u2022 To keep the score increasing, the player needs to dodge a rain of bombs that fall non-stop and collect bonus lives that drop every 15 seconds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182710/extras/7d9cfb0507d6b59b4040f77d45e5be9f.poster.avif?t=1767728752\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182710/extras/7d9cfb0507d6b59b4040f77d45e5be9f.webm?t=1767728752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182710/extras/7d9cfb0507d6b59b4040f77d45e5be9f.mp4?t=1767728752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2>\u2022 Bonuses to increase speed and lives that help the game's performance;<br><br>\u2022 Score multiplier bonus up to 10 times over time during a match;<br>\u2022 Increased amount and speed of bombs that fall over time, making the game more challenging during a match;<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack and pleasant sound effects;<br>\u2022 Various visual effects and changes in brightness according to 4 (four) phases of the day: morning, noon, afternoon and night, for visual satisfaction and game contemplation;<br>\u2022 A book with ancient wisdom in the pause menu, translated into three languages \u200b\u200b(Portuguese (Brazil), Spanish and English);<br>\u2022 443 Toy-based Skins, with 22 skins unlocked with the maximum score obtained in matches;<br>\u2022 The game saves your overall record and keeps the maximum score achieved.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"High Score 1500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/ff7678513ed8be81187c11c943879d714ca3087b.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 3000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/4c741fd78751a61a70b68355366831dbe09be1b3.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 4500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/fb3b73d487cbf1a0137621862edf9040b9ddd446.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 6000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/2a2aa4e6eef4f17a09282aebaefbd709405779bc.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 7500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/8750fea15479c47d6f4899d47de75a426cb8d59d.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 9000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/f68e1f950c9b955197b26d467a4c7f3688e4d328.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 10500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/ab146563ede2210d246964a52caf152eb681a961.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 12000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/5a929e15acd068941b56f3f5ddbe2bb99650a4e3.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 13500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/f1203e3ce4c6fa507d0b50f3e0181794abe2f1e3.jpg"},{"name":"High Score 15000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2182710/98ce559ebd7c2e9e07c62b8418c5be067726cd92.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2182710?t=1767728752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767728752","capsule_image"