 multiplier bonus up to 10 times over time during a match;<br>\u2022 Increased amount and speed of bombs that fall over time, making the game more challenging during a match;<br>\u2022 Relaxing soundtrack and pleasant sound effects;<br>\u2022 Various visual effects and changes in brightness according to 4 (four) phases of the day: morning, noon, afternoon and night, for visual satisfaction and game contemplation;<br>\u2022 A book with ancient wisdom in the pause menu, translated into three languages \u200b\u200b(Portuguese (Brazil), Spanish and English);<br>\u2022 443 Toy-based Skins, with 22 skins unlocked with the maximum score obtained in matches;<br>\u2022 The game saves your overall record and keeps the maximum score achieved.","developers":["Milo's Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2182710/header.jpg?t=1767728752","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2182710/504309/e4f8a1f5bfea89a9c50ddb5af1b6dbda97a7c9e7/1751086609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1666730477","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2182710/504309/e4f8a1f5bfea89a9c50ddb5af1b6dbda97a7c9e7/1751086609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1666730477","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2182710/504309/e4f8a1f5bfea89a9c50ddb5af1b6dbda97a7c9e7/1751086609/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1666730477","id":256910606,"name":"Trailer em Ingl\u00eas","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256910606/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1666730477"},{"dash